<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cytec Industries started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cytec Industries started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it initiated coverage of Cytec Industries Inc as a buy and set a $45 a share price target.</p>
<p>-- said it expects Cytec to earn $2.20 a share in 1997 and $2.65 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Cytec lost 1/4 to 38-3/4.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
